# Keep AGENTS.md in sync

`AGENTS.md` is an index. Detail stays in `docs/`.

In the same change that edits any of these, update the matching one-line summary in `AGENTS.md`:

- `docs/agents/issue-tracker.md`
- `docs/agents/domain.md`
- `docs/workflow.md`
- `docs/glossary.md`
- `docs/trial-log.md`
- `docs/runbook.md`

Add a new index line when a new doc under `docs/` is something agents must read. Do not paste those docs into `AGENTS.md`.
